00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.576
- I'M T-RAY TOMBSTONE.

00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:11.377
- AND WE'RE HERE TO TEACH Y'ALL
HOW TO...

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.279
both:
GO DOWN ON BITCHES RIGHT.

00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:14.580
- NOW BITCHES AIN'T BEING
SATISFIED, SO CHECK IT.

00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:16.349
- QUIT SUCKING
ON THAT [bleep] SO DAMN HARD.

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:17.717
- BITCHES DON'T LIKE
THAT NONSENSE.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.185
- THAT'S LIKE PUTTING THE TIP

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:20.486
OF YOUR PENIS
IN THE VACUUM.

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:22.688
- Y'ALL NEED TO...
both: CHILL ON THE [bleep].

00:00:22.721 --> 00:00:24.624
- GO AROUND THAT BUSINESS.
- THAT'S LIKE A BUTTON

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:26.192
MADE OF A MILLION PENIS TOPS.

00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:27.660
- NOW EVERY BITCH
LIKE HER CUNNILINGUS

00:00:27.693 --> 00:00:29.729
A LITTLE BIT DIFFERENT.
- VAGINAS ARE LIKE SNOWFLAKES.

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:32.231
- SNOWFLAKES IS DIFFERENT.
LEARN YOUR BITCH'S SNOWFLAKE.

00:00:32.264 --> 00:00:33.466
- ASK YOUR BITCH
WHAT SHE WANTS.

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:35.401
both: THEN DO WHAT SHE SAYS.

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:36.235
- SOME BITCHES LIKE IT
IN CIRCLES.

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:37.503
- SOME BITCHES
LIKE IT UP AND DOWN.

00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:39.072
- SOME BITCHES LIKE IT HARD.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.339
- SOME BITCHES LIKE IT SOFT.

00:00:40.372 --> 00:00:42.442
both: COMMUNICATE
WITH YOUR BITCHES.

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:43.509
- MAKE THE ALPHABET
WITH YOUR TONGUE.

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:46.112
- A-B-C-D...

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:47.080
- AND WHEN SHE GRAB YOUR HAIR

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.381
LIKE SHE GONNA PULL
YOUR DAMN HEAD OFF...

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:50.283
both: STAY WITH THAT LETTER.

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:53.086
- I'M TALKING ABOUT B...
[blathers]

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:55.154
- OR D...
[blathers]

00:00:55.187 --> 00:00:57.156
both: VAGINAS DESERVE RESPECT.

00:00:57.189 --> 00:00:58.491
- YOU DON'T WANT SOMEONE
SLAPPING AROUND

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:01.160
YOUR LITTLE HOMEY.
[yelping]

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:02.428
- YOU WITH THE HAT.
- YO.

00:01:02.461 --> 00:01:03.796
- HOW YOU LIKE YOUR BJs?

00:01:03.829 --> 00:01:06.466
- DAMN, DOG,
ALL THE TIME.

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.301
- SHUT THE [bleep] UP!

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:09.402
THAT'S 'CAUSE PENISES IS EASY,

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:10.503
AND VAGINAS IS HARD.

00:01:10.536 --> 00:01:13.306
THEY'RE...
both: CONFUSING!

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.575
- IMAGINE THERE'S AN EXPLOSION
AT THE ENVELOPE FACTORY.

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.477
- FLAPS EVERYWHERE.
A WORLD OF FLAPS.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.645
- AND YOU NEED TO LICK YOUR WAY
OUT THE FACTORY.

00:01:19.678 --> 00:01:21.347
- BUT EVERY BITCH'S FLAPS
IS DIFFERENT.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.849
- LEARN YOUR BITCH'S
PARTICULAR FLAPS.

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:25.384
- FLAPS BE...
both: CRAZY!

00:01:25.417 --> 00:01:27.220
- EVERY FLAP
NEED TO BE LISTENED TO.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:28.354
- AND THEN YOU WILL GET OUT
OF THAT FACTORY ALIVE.

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:29.689
- STAY DOWN THERE.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:32.692
both: PLAN YOUR BREATHING
LIKE YOUR SWIMMING.

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.527
- YOU GOTTA BE TALKING ABOUT...
both: STROKE, STROKE, BREATHE.

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:35.761
STROKE, STROKE, BREATHE.

00:01:35.794 --> 00:01:37.797
[gasping]

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.398
- ALL RIGHT.
LET'S TAKE A FIVE-MINUTE BREAK.

00:01:39.431 --> 00:01:40.499
- AND WHEN WE COME BACK,
WE GONNA TALK

00:01:40.532 --> 00:01:41.567
ABOUT WARMING YOUR BITCHES UP
BEFORE YOU GET BUSY.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:43.503
- AND HOW TO LAST
FOR MORE THAN TWO DAMN MINUTES.

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:45.138
- TAKE A PEACH AND PRACTICE.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:46.506
- PRACTICE ON A PEACH.
- TAKE A PEACH AND PRACTICE.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.673 line:91%
- PRACTICE ON A PEACH.
